494	  - `PromptBundle` with data-model.md `PromptBundle.system`, `PromptBundle.prompt`, `PromptBundle.marker_id`, `PromptBundle.prompt_version`, `PromptBundle.system_sha256`, `PromptBundle.prompt_chars`;
495	  - `PROMPT_VERSION = "p1"` (data-model.md `Settings.PROMPT_VERSION`);
496	  - `SECTIONS` with the US1 sections listed in T031, including the **PROVISIONAL P-2** currency rule;
497	  - `build(text)`.
498	  - At most two short synthetic few-shot examples, none taken from `evals/dataset.json`.
499	- [ ] T038 [P] [US1] Extend `src/order_agent/validators.py` with the MR and post-validation checks (research.md R-5, R-7):
500	  - `check_mr(obj)`: `MR-SCHEMA` against `model-response.schema.json`, then MC-2 and MC-3 as `MR-CONSIST` over data-model.md `ModelResponse.company`, `ModelResponse.company_quote`, `ModelResponse.announcement_date`, `ModelResponse.announcement_date_quote`, `ModelResponse.order_type`, `ModelResponse.order_type_quote`, `ModelResponse.execution_period`, `ModelResponse.execution_period_quote`, `MROrder.order_value`, `MROrder.currency`, `MROrder.unit`, `MROrder.client`, `MROrder.value_quote`, `MROrder.client_quote`;
501	  - `post_validate(source, result)` running OUT-SCHEMA, OUT-DATE, G-1 … G-5, C-1, C-3 and C-4 (over data-model.md `ExtractionResult.unstated_fields`, **PROVISIONAL P-5**) and collecting every error;
502	  - helpers `ws_norm`, `canon_digits`, `digits_only`, `name_norm` (the FR-029 name normalisation) and `EXCHANGE_DENYLIST` (R-7 G-5 list).
503	  - MC-1 is added in T062 and C-2 in T079.
504	- [ ] T039 [US1] Implement `src/order_agent/agent.py` (depends on T025, T026, T036–T038; data-model.md Pipeline states):
505	  - `Success` with data-model.md `Success.result`, `Success.model_called`, `Success.attempts`, `Success.parser_log`, `Success.assembly_trace`;
506	  - `ApplicationFailure` with `ApplicationFailure.stage`, `ApplicationFailure.errors`, `ApplicationFailure.raw_text`, `ApplicationFailure.parser_log`, `ApplicationFailure.candidate`, `ApplicationFailure.attempts`;
507	  - `ServiceFailure` with `ServiceFailure.attempts`, `ServiceFailure.last_kind`;
508	  - `assemble(mr)` for `is_new_order: true`, implementing A-2 (staged: `orders[0]` is top-level and the rest follow in appearance order), A-3, A-4, A-5, A-6, A-7 and A-8 (**PROVISIONAL P-5**).
509	    - It produces data-model.md `ExtractionResult.schema_version`, `ExtractionResult.status`, `ExtractionResult.company`, `ExtractionResult.announcement_date`, `ExtractionResult.order`, `ExtractionResult.additional_orders`, `ExtractionResult.evidence`, `ExtractionResult.missing_fields`, `ExtractionResult.unstated_fields`, `ExtractionResult.rejection_reason`, `Order.order_value`, `Order.currency`, `Order.unit`, `Order.client`, `Order.order_type`, `Order.execution_period` and `AdditionalOrder.evidence`.
510	    - It never creates or alters a value.
511	    - `is_new_order: false` raises `NotImplementedError` until T064;
512	  - `run(raw, settings, *, transport, sleep)`: guards → prompt → `client.generate` → parser → `check_mr` → assemble → `post_validate` → outcome.
513	- [ ] T040 [US1] Implement `src/order_agent/cli.py` and `src/order_agent/__main__.py` per contracts/cli.md: arguments (`<file>` or `-`, `--env-file`); `./.env` by default if present; exit codes 0, 2, 3, 64 and 78; the stdout/stderr separation and JSON formats; the pin warning; `main(argv, *, transport, stdin, stdout, stderr)`
514	- [ ] T041 [US1] US1 green run with the green-run gate commands (rev 2): `.venv/bin/pytest` (the full suite), `.venv/bin/ruff check .`, `.venv/bin/ruff format --check .`, `.venv/bin/bandit -r src .harness -ll` and `grep -rn --include="*.py" nosec src .harness` (no output)
515	
516	**Checkpoint**: US1 is functional. One announcement gives a verified schema-1.0 result, or an
517	explicit application or service failure.
518	
519	---
520	
521	## Phase 4: User Story 5 - Evaluator decides ACCEPT/REJECT from evidence (Priority: P1)
522	
523	**Goal**: one evaluation runner, `.harness/run_eval.py`. It gates the dataset, checks the pins,
524	scores layers 1–3 independently of the agent's own checks, asks the informational judge, computes
525	the FR-031 verdict mechanically, and writes the complete evidence folder.
526	
527	**Independent Test**: load `run_eval.py` with `importlib`. Drive `run(root=tmp_path, …,
528	agent_run=<scripted>)` with a **scripted agent**, i.e. a stand-in that returns canned
529	`AgentOutcome`s per case id. `FakeTransport` scripts only the pin-check endpoints and the judge.
530	Check the verdict rules AC-5.1 … AC-5.6 and the output layout in contracts/eval-results.md.
531	- No real model or judge is called.
532	- **The real `order_agent.agent.run` is not run over the dataset in this phase**, because the
533	  guards, triage and multi-order ranking do not exist yet (rev 2, F1). That end-to-end check is
534	  T095, in Phase 8.
535	
536	### Tests for User Story 5 (write first, confirm red) ⚠️
